    "board": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6260,
      "w": 640,
      "fill": "blue",
      "text": "Orders views\n\n- List: one row per contractor, one column per product, Total row at the bottom, Made row with ticks.\n- Matrix: one row per product, one column per contractor, Total column, tick per product.\n- Products: one tile per product with total and made progress.\n- The chosen view is saved on the person's account and stays until they switch.\n- Products are A to Z; no product groups.\n- Made: tap to tick; green with a check and the word Made, never colour alone."
    },
